      "content": "The settlement's instrument is only used to look up execution times, not to verify that it is the contract being settled. For example, an O-C opening followed by an expiration naming OS_CONTRACT with the same quantity passes validation and consumes O-C's lots from the shared replay queue. Validate that the expiration names the held contract (or track quantities/lots per instrument) before allowing it to dispose exposure.",
