      "content": "Settlement fact IDs bypass the existing `seen` duplicate checks. If an expiration reuses a partial closing execution's ID, `disposedOf` classifies both disposals as settlements, yielding FullyHeldToExpirationSettlement instead of Mixed and ambiguous lot-match identities. Include settlements in the same identity validation as executions and Position Changes, and support an Expiration-headed DuplicateFactId finding.",
