      "content": "This accepts a zero-quantity expiration after a previous expiration has already flattened the position. Appending that fact moves terminalTime and the terminal Position Change to a settlement that disposed nothing, without reporting incoherence. Require a positive open quantity and positive settlement quantity before accepting the settlement, and add coverage for repeated settlements after closure.",
